{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever wanted to be the one doing the firing?</strong><br>This game is for everyone who's always been on the receiving end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Game</strong><br><i>Fire Them All</i> is a first-person shooter where you \u201cfire\u201d employees\u2014literally\u2014by sending termination emails across the office battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play from an FPS perspective using your trusty office PC.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim and shoot <strong>termination emails</strong> at employees to \u201cfire\u201d them on the spot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once all employees in the field are fired, you clear the stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the ultimate power fantasy of downsizing at will!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the <strong>thrill of firing employees</strong>, something you could never do in real life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet strangely satisfying mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A humorous twist on corporate life.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930310?t=1761145886","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930310?t=1761145886","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930310/4423ba431e7efad6d277170d8736ff065b3dbcaa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761145886","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930310/4423ba431e7efad6d277170d8736ff065b3dbcaa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761145886","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"c